    "Off-peak slots (hour=22) with low max_capacity should predict near 0.",
    "Rush-hour slots (rush_hour=1) at lunch time should predict moderate-high (0.4-0.9).",
    "avg_completion_minutes that is high (>25) suggests congested/slow slot → high occupancy.",
    "Ranges are ±0.3 around expected since training data may be sparse.",
    "Prediction must always be in [0.0, 1.0]; any value outside is a clear regression."
